sequenceDiagram
    participant AU as Author
    participant FE as WritePage
    participant API as API
    participant D as MongoDB
    AU->>FE: open published story for edit
    FE->>API: GET /api/submissions/:id
    API-->>FE: live document
    AU->>FE: save changes
    FE->>API: PUT /api/submissions/:id
    API->>D: status == PUBLISHED ?
    alt published
        API->>D: create copy with draftOf = :id
        D-->>API: shadow draft saved
        API-->>FE: shadow draft returned (live untouched)
    else not published
        API->>D: update document in place
        API-->>FE: updated
    end
    AU->>FE: resubmit shadow draft
    FE->>API: submit draft
    API->>D: moderation rescan, status → PENDING_REVIEW
    Note over D: Live story remains PUBLISHED until approval replaces it
